  "Unlock <link\\=\"s|247\"><u>Exclusive Buff Items</u></link>. When using [Faraway Flower], gain 1 [Flower of Dream] stack. At the start of Minami's turn, she can spend 1 [Flower of Dream] to gain [Memory Prescription].": "",
