  "Minami no longer spends items when using any items. Extend all <link\\=\"s|248\"><u>Buff Item</u></link> effect by 1 turn. When Minami has [Memory Prescription] and uses an item on allies, grant the main target [Revitalization Boost]: Increase Total DMG Amp by $1 for $2 turn.": "",
